    "estimated": "11.50 occ x 30 min/occ (estimate, mid of 15-75, basis inferred, 6 quotes from 6 occurrences) = 345.00 min = 14.98 min/mo; automatable 35% (estimate) = 5.24 min/mo; at the low end 15 min/occ = $6.12/mo, at the high end 75 min/occ = $20.98/mo (the row's automatable total)",
